                    {
                        "translation_id": "a8f423e4-f516-4f8b-ab2f-d15432178771",
                        "source_entry_id": "3cba9a5d-71a8-3185-8918-085a034b026b",
                        "source_sense_description": "Qui a rapport aux astres.",
                        "target_lang_word": "astral",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "astral",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28d52fbe-4409-3337-ae30-a5e9d290c498",
                                        "entry_id": "1730b7c0-d327-3a18-a57f-a5c64c64139a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to or resembling the stars; starry."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72a2bfe3-c714-485d-b2a4-88e8a5b96c3a",
                                                "sense_id": "28d52fbe-4409-3337-ae30-a5e9d290c498",
                                                "text": "Some Aſtral forms I muſt invoke by prayer, / Fram'd of all pureſt Atoms of the Air; [...]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "26d3abcd-0843-3091-a1b7-36c74d5cc479",
                                        "entry_id": "1730b7c0-d327-3a18-a57f-a5c64c64139a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to an aster."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f022ca7-7bb8-4fd5-b9d1-1226aab5ac84",
                                                "sense_id": "26d3abcd-0843-3091-a1b7-36c74d5cc479",
                                                "text": "astral rays"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33693759-4744-4157-888c-2331a949d5b1",
                                                "sense_id": "26d3abcd-0843-3091-a1b7-36c74d5cc479",
                                                "text": "astral sphere"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b955a7d3-9d6a-32c2-a365-5ed2a05183a8",
                                        "entry_id": "1730b7c0-d327-3a18-a57f-a5c64c64139a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Composed of ethereal material or non-physical (sometimes supersensible), and capable of sometimes separating from the physical body (as an astral body) to travel to other places or to other realms of existence (in or via the astral plane)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84c51610-ff50-40cf-b61e-735fcd0e728d",
                                                "sense_id": "b955a7d3-9d6a-32c2-a365-5ed2a05183a8",
                                                "text": "In the case of an inanimate body, […] when the physical object was broken the astral counterpart would also be divided; but it would not be possible to break an astral counterpart, and in that way to affect the physical object. In other words the act of fraction must begin on the physical plane. One could of course move a purely astral object by means of an astral hand if one wished, but not the astral counterpart of a physical object. In order to perform this latter feat it would be necessary to materialize a hand and move the physical object, when the astral counterpart would of course accompany it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8121cb3-9486-424b-94ac-9bd695d1c338",
                                                "sense_id": "b955a7d3-9d6a-32c2-a365-5ed2a05183a8",
                                                "text": "\"[I could] see her astral form sitting on the edge of her bed. She was waiting for me.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd3691db-1366-4d37-950e-c2d721901df0",
                                                "sense_id": "b955a7d3-9d6a-32c2-a365-5ed2a05183a8",
                                                "text": "[He could] see her astral projection; she looked like a celestial being, holding her hand out to him. With relief rushing through his body, he called out to her, \"I've got you angel, and I'm coming!\" Hammering the gas the car took off[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a614336-2994-4b5e-9eee-d5b8c492b190",
                                                "sense_id": "b955a7d3-9d6a-32c2-a365-5ed2a05183a8",
                                                "text": "[Other actions], such as the moving of solid articles, either by an astral hand projected to draw them towards her, or by using an Elemental; others by reading in the Astral Light, and so on. But the proof of the reality of her mission from those whom she spoke of as Masters lay not in these[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "astral",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75d474e4-9a9f-3f16-8f23-6c9db5206605",
                                        "entry_id": "da2964e3-9adb-3f31-871a-9ac1689b2e91",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A supernatural being from the astral plane."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c70d28f-2453-43b7-9fcc-b9720b0aeec9",
                                                "sense_id": "75d474e4-9a9f-3f16-8f23-6c9db5206605",
                                                "text": "Now both of you sit there and wait for any guides to come to you, any astrals or people from that life to make themselves known to you."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "46bc9a25-42f2-48cb-8b32-99d2fe17f2d1",
                        "source_entry_id": "3cba9a5d-71a8-3185-8918-085a034b026b",
                        "source_sense_description": "Qui a rapport aux astres.",
                        "target_lang_word": "starry",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "starry",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0172527-70b1-34eb-8141-66549bc7f65c",
                                        "entry_id": "21b4e020-3134-3874-acb6-c4fda2c989c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having stars visible."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f40ceac-c1a9-4f31-818d-cbf51f45ed4c",
                                                "sense_id": "d0172527-70b1-34eb-8141-66549bc7f65c",
                                                "text": "starry night"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13411db1-42ed-449d-8a20-402c0fb6f418",
                                                "sense_id": "d0172527-70b1-34eb-8141-66549bc7f65c",
                                                "text": "Alyssa stared out of her window at the starry night sky."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "196dd66d-1131-3ee6-b389-642873d95817",
                                        "entry_id": "21b4e020-3134-3874-acb6-c4fda2c989c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resembling or shaped like a star."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fa6bb7e-61ec-4e79-a1f8-300396801965",
                                                "sense_id": "196dd66d-1131-3ee6-b389-642873d95817",
                                                "text": "I shrank from the starry waters as they rose to my lip, but a power stronger than my will compelled me to their taste."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0bcf63b-61ca-4007-abfb-591d1eadad67",
                                                "sense_id": "196dd66d-1131-3ee6-b389-642873d95817",
                                                "text": "An old shrub long grown in gardens for its irregular yellow flowers of peculiar starry shape, coming from October to December."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2183461-0890-3ce4-83b2-071946ecb032",
                                        "entry_id": "21b4e020-3134-3874-acb6-c4fda2c989c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Full of stars or celebrities."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2953cbf-d265-4163-9454-47f997dac64f",
                                                "sense_id": "e2183461-0890-3ce4-83b2-071946ecb032",
                                                "text": "Despite a starry cast, the film performed poorly at the box office."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20f78fc4-bf1b-4e12-a89b-352d8f86ceda",
                                                "sense_id": "e2183461-0890-3ce4-83b2-071946ecb032",
                                                "text": "A starry 20th-anniversary revival of “Topdog/Underdog,” her Pulitzer Prize-winning fable about two brothers, three-card monte and one troubling inheritance, is in previews on Broadway."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77ea0576-41dd-42a5-9ec5-a441c23a574a",
                                                "sense_id": "e2183461-0890-3ce4-83b2-071946ecb032",
                                                "text": "After a bit of digging, we discovered she follows a stringent workout and nutrition regime, masterminded by Patrick Murphy — a celeb PT with a super-starry roster, including Zac Efron, Keanu Reeves and Ruby Rose — with a focus on overall health rather than aesthetics."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
